/**
 * Project: OpenCC for EmEditor Macro v0.25
 * Author: skyuns (https://github.com/skyuns/EmEditor-OpenCC-Macro)
 * This macro provides foundational conversion based on the OpenCC core lexicon. Note that results may vary from the official implementation.
 * (本巨集基於 OpenCC 核心詞庫提供基礎繁簡轉換。請注意，轉換結果可能與官方執行版本有所出入。)
 * Data Source: OpenCC (https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC)
 * License: Apache License 2.0
 * 轉換流程：1. 讀取用語字典 -> 2. 封裝 Trie 字典樹 -> 3. 動態分段由下往上執行 FMM 匹配
 * 簡易測試：由於內存不足，導致高清視頻的優化過程卡死，連硬盤裡的文件都無法讀取。
 * 參考結果：由於記憶體不足，導致高畫質影片的最佳化過程卡死，連硬碟裡的檔案都無法讀取。 (僅做用語轉換)
 * [Disclaimer] The simulator comparison feature is a non-official API implementation provided by Gemini for personal research; users assume all risks regarding potential IP rate-limiting. Default is disabled.
 */

